# Render webhook misconfigurations as clean startup failures (description + action) rather than raw stack
# traces. FailureAnalyzers are loaded before the application context, so they are registered here via
# spring.factories (not the AutoConfiguration.imports mechanism).
#   - WebhookClientFailureAnalyzer:        a malformed @WebhookClient interface/method.
#   - WebhookConfigurationFailureAnalyzer: a bad destination URL/secret or a v2a (Ed25519) key/endpoint-id.
org.springframework.boot.diagnostics.FailureAnalyzer=\
com.jinternals.webhooks.producer.client.registrar.WebhookClientFailureAnalyzer,\
com.jinternals.webhooks.producer.config.WebhookConfigurationFailureAnalyzer
